# Enforce LF everywhere. Export determinism (§6.3) requires LF endings in the
# published dataset; normalizing the whole repo keeps CRLF off Windows dev
# boxes from ever entering data/ and breaking byte-identical double-export.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
